$ graphify install --project --platform aider
  skill installed  ->  .aider/graphify/SKILL.md
graphify section written to <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/AGENTS.md

Aider will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

Note: unlike Claude Code, there is no PreToolUse hook equivalent for
Aider — the AGENTS.md rules are the always-on mechanism.

Project-scoped install. Add to version control:
  git add .aider/ AGENTS.md

$ graphify aider install
graphify already configured in <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/AGENTS.md (no change)

Aider will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

Note: unlike Claude Code, there is no PreToolUse hook equivalent for
Aider — the AGENTS.md rules are the always-on mechanism.
